window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-6c3aed9dab628df5"]={"zh":"<p><a id=\"slash-commands\"></a></p> <h1 id=\"_1\">斜杠命令</h1> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取文档的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <p>斜杠命令可让你在不离开聊天输入框的情况下执行操作。可用命令会因你的环境和访问权限而异。</p> <p><a id=\"use-a-slash-command\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_2\">使用斜杠命令</h2> <ol> <li>在聊天输入框中输入 <code>/</code>。</li> <li>从列表中选择一个命令，或继续输入以筛选（例如 <code>/status</code>）。</li> </ol> <p>你也可以在聊天输入框中输入 <code>$</code>，以明确调用技能。请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">技能与插件</a>。</p> <p>已启用的技能也会显示在斜杠命令列表中。自定义提示会显示为 <code>/prompts:&lt;name&gt;</code> 命令。</p> <p><a id=\"available-slash-commands\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"_3\">可用的斜杠命令</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>斜杠命令</th> <th>说明</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>/approve</code></td> <td>当自动审查处于启用状态时，批准对最近一次自动审查拒绝结果进行一次重试。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/archive</code></td> <td>归档当前聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/chat</code></td> <td>在开始新聊天之前，选择一个不关联项目的聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud</code></td> <td>在云端运行聊天（仅在云端执行可用时）。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud-environment</code></td> <td>为聊天选择云端环境。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/compact</code></td> <td>压缩当前聊天的上下文。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fast</code></td> <td>在可用时，启用或关闭目录提供的 Fast 服务层级。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/feedback</code></td> <td>打开反馈对话框以提交反馈，也可以选择附上日志。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fork</code></td> <td>将本地聊天复制到新的本地聊天或工作树。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/goal</code></td> <td>设置 ChatGPT 要持续推进的目标；先使用 <code>/plan</code> 梳理目标。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/ide-context</code></td> <td>启用或关闭共享的 IDE 上下文。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/init</code></td> <td>为当前项目生成 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 脚手架。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/local</code></td> <td>在所选本地项目中运行聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/mcp</code></td> <td>打开 MCP 状态，查看已连接的服务器。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/memories</code></td> <td>在记忆功能可用时，配置聊天是否可以使用或生成记忆。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/model</code></td> <td>为当前聊天选择模型。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/new</code></td> <td>在可用时，在同一个本地工作区中新建空白聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/pet</code></td> <td>唤醒或收起桌面宠物。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/pin</code></td> <td>在可用时，固定或取消固定当前聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/plan</code></td> <td>为多步骤规划任务切换计划模式。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/project</code></td> <td>为新聊天选择项目。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/reasoning</code></td> <td>选择推理强度。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/rename</code></td> <td>重命名当前聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/review</code></td> <td>启动代码审查模式，以审查未提交的更改或与基准分支进行比较。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/side</code></td> <td>启动一个临时侧边聊天，不中断主聊天。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/status</code></td> <td>显示聊天 ID、上下文用量和速率限制。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/usage</code></td> <td>在通过 ChatGPT 登录且此功能可用时，打开用量和账单设置。</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/worktree</code></td> <td>在新的 Git 工作树中运行聊天。</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <p><a id=\"set-or-manage-a-goal-with-goal\"></a></p> <h2 id=\"goal\">使用 <code>/goal</code> 设置或管理目标</h2> <p>在应用的输入框中使用 <code>/goal</code> 可启动目标模式。目标模式会持续推进目标，直到任务完成、暂停或需要更多输入。若要先与 ChatGPT 一起完善目标，可先使用 <code>/plan</code>，再使用 <code>/goal</code> 保存明确后的目标。</p> <blockquote> <p>插图：ChatGPT 桌面应用中输入框上方的目标进度控件</p> </blockquote> <p>目标处于活动状态时，应用会在输入框上方显示进度。请使用进度栏中的按钮暂停或恢复目标、编辑目标文字，或清除目标，而不要再输入另一条斜杠命令。目标运行期间，你仍可通过后续消息继续引导 ChatGPT。</p> <p>有关如何编写有效目标的指导，请参阅 <a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">目标模式</a>。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"slash-commands\">Slash commands</h1> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <p>Slash commands let you run actions without leaving the chat composer. Available commands vary based on your environment and access.</p> <h2 id=\"use-a-slash-command\">Use a slash command</h2> <ol> <li>In the chat composer, type <code>/</code>.</li> <li>Select a command from the list, or keep typing to filter (for example, <code>/status</code>).</li> </ol> <p>You can also explicitly invoke skills by typing <code>$</code> in the chat composer. See <a href=\"#/article/a-f06621b97709dae2\">Skills &amp; Plugins</a>.</p> <p>Enabled skills also appear in the slash command list. Custom prompts appear as <code>/prompts:&lt;name&gt;</code> commands.</p> <h2 id=\"available-slash-commands\">Available slash commands</h2> <table> <thead> <tr> <th>Slash command</th> <th>Description</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><code>/approve</code></td> <td>Approve one retry of a recent automatic-review denial, when automatic review is active.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/archive</code></td> <td>Archive the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/chat</code></td> <td>Choose a chat without a project before starting a new chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud</code></td> <td>Run the chat in the cloud, when cloud execution is available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/cloud-environment</code></td> <td>Choose the cloud environment for the chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/compact</code></td> <td>Compact the current chat's context.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fast</code></td> <td>Turn a catalog-provided Fast service tier on or off, when available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/feedback</code></td> <td>Open the feedback dialog to submit feedback and optionally include logs.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/fork</code></td> <td>Copy a local chat into a new local chat or worktree.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/goal</code></td> <td>Set a persistent goal for ChatGPT to work toward; use <code>/plan</code> first to shape it.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/ide-context</code></td> <td>Turn shared IDE context on or off.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/init</code></td> <td>Generate an <code>AGENTS.md</code> scaffold for the current project.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/local</code></td> <td>Run the chat in the selected local project.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/mcp</code></td> <td>Open MCP status to view connected servers.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/memories</code></td> <td>Configure whether the chat can use or generate memories, when Memories is available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/model</code></td> <td>Choose the model for the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/new</code></td> <td>Start a blank chat in the same local workspace, when available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/pet</code></td> <td>Wake or tuck away the desktop pet.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/pin</code></td> <td>Pin or unpin the current chat, when available.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/plan</code></td> <td>Toggle plan mode for multi-step planning.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/project</code></td> <td>Choose a project for new chats.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/reasoning</code></td> <td>Choose the reasoning effort for the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/rename</code></td> <td>Rename the current chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/review</code></td> <td>Start code review mode to review uncommitted changes or compare against a base branch.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/side</code></td> <td>Start a temporary side chat without interrupting the main chat.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/status</code></td> <td>Show the chat ID, context usage, and rate limits.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/usage</code></td> <td>Open usage and billing settings, when available with ChatGPT sign-in.</td> </tr> <tr> <td><code>/worktree</code></td> <td>Run the chat in a new Git worktree.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <h2 id=\"set-or-manage-a-goal-with-goal\">Set or manage a goal with <code>/goal</code></h2> <p>Use <code>/goal</code> in the app composer to start Goal mode. A goal is a persistent objective that ChatGPT works toward until it finishes the task, pauses, or needs more input. To define the goal with ChatGPT first, start with <code>/plan</code>, then set the refined goal with <code>/goal</code>.</p> <blockquote> <p>Illustration: ChatGPT desktop app goal progress controls above the composer</p> </blockquote> <p>When a goal is active, the app shows its progress above the composer. Use the buttons in that progress row to pause or resume the goal, edit the goal text, or clear the goal instead of typing another slash command. You can keep steering ChatGPT with follow-up messages while the goal runs.</p> <p>For guidance on writing effective goals, see <a href=\"#/article/a-0310706ee8617b64?anchor=goal-mode\">Goal mode</a>.</p>"};
